{"title": "Unbridled Wrath (Condition)", "pageid": 29263, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Unbridled_Wrath_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Generic Explosion Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Unbridled Wrath</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Releasing a decade of pent-up rage in a blaze of infernal fury.</li>\n<li>The affected entity is <a href=\"/wiki/Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immunity\">Immune</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\">Fire</a> damage. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/38px-Plus_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Status groups\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Rage\" title=\"SG Rage\">SG_Rage</a>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/LoseControl\" title=\"Status properties/LoseControl\">LoseControl</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Warning_Icon.png/25px-Warning_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Warning_Icon.png/38px-Warning_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/7/71/Warning_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Warning Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Warning_Icon.png/25px-Warning_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/71/Warning_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <span style=\"color: #EB2C60;\">An affected party member is fully controlled by the game's AI, which may behave in unexpected ways.</span></li>\n<li>Temporarily acquired by <a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\">Karlach</a> immediately after killing <a href=\"/wiki/Anders\" title=\"Anders\">Anders</a> and the other \"Paladins of Tyr.\"</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203425\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1085/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9892/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2972/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 985786/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   38.977      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   38.977      1 -total\n 50.23%   19.580      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 18.46%    7.195      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 13.43%    5.234     13 Template:Trim\n 12.27%    4.781      2 Template:Icon_link\n 11.55%    4.503      1 Template:PageSeo\n 11.33%    4.415      2 Template:Icon_text\n  9.76%    3.803      3 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  8.95%    3.488      2 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:29263-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714203425 and revision id 342077. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}